Rigidity type atlas
  static multiplicative   | (Z/n)* acts on j/n                 | keeps: AP unit witnesses, local straddle pins
                          |                                    | loses: nonunit clocks and endpoint payload
  dynamical doubling      | x -> 2x on witness residues        | keeps: odd-n propagation and binary IFS
                          |                                    | loses: even-n unit fiber; n=14 fragments
  dihedral reflective     | j <-> -j                           | keeps: antipodal jaws and pincer symmetry
                          |                                    | loses: orientation/source side unless labelled
  CRT channel             | projection to prime-power factors  | keeps: localizes defects to one block
                          |                                    | loses: cross-factor owner/endpoint coupling
  quotient transport      | object -> fiber bucket             | keeps: empty/rigid/leaking/transport rows
                          |                                    | loses: mixed predicate values in forgotten fibers
  monodromy               | loop in quotient lifts to label permutation | keeps: trivial holonomy gives cascade
                          |                                    | loses: nontrivial loop hides observer coupling
  isostatic               | constraint graph on active obligations | keeps: critical rigidity counts
                          |                                    | loses: over/underconstrained local cover cores
  spectral character      | Fourier/Dirichlet blocks on orbit  | keeps: block-diagonal defect ledger
                          |                                    | loses: gcd>1 and 2-adic leakage
  fiber stiffness         | boundary vs inner label flips      | keeps: anisotropy of a fixed class
                          |                                    | loses: ensemble isotropy hides class stiffness
  source functor          | delete/add marked source           | keeps: exact fixed-point cascade
                          |                                    | loses: generic rooted shadows without incidents

